OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court charged with
OL,4,Awoman's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith the murder of a 46-year-old woman
OL,8,Fand the attempted murder of a
OL,9,F20-year-old woman.
OL,11,FBilal Ajmal, 26, of Carr Bottom Road,
OL,12,FLittle Horton, Bradford, appeared at
OL,13,FBradford Magistrates' Court charged
OL,14,Fwith the murder of Tahira Hussain.
OL,16,FThe 20-year-old woman continued to be
OL,17,Ftreated in hospital for serious
OL,18,Finjuries, police said.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
