OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court charged with
OL,4,Awoman's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FMagistrate Presley Douglas told the
OL,7,Fdefendant the seriousness of the case
OL,8,Fmeant it could not be dealt with at
OL,9,Fmagistrates' court and said Ajmal would
OL,10,Fappear at Bradford Crown Court for his
OL,11,Fnext hearing on Friday.
